# K7-1 — topology-routed group voting vs the candidate-blind group

- registration: K7-1 (koalisi #90)
- prereg: `docs/k7/prereg-K7-1-topology-routed-group.md` (Amendments 1 and 2 included)
- koalisi: v0.38.0
- seeds: 90..120 (30 seeds)
- outcome signal: RoleCoverage
- world: `WorkflowSpec::default()` — universe_bits 8, pool 4..=16, caps_per_agent 1..=4, trust 20..=99, tasks 20, required_bits 2..=8, roles 3, redraw_cap 1000, fanout_denom 4, performance None

## Gates

- **X-battery** — checked outside this binary: one serial run of `examples/strategy_comparison.rs` diffed against `docs/runs/K4-archive.log` with the latency column stripped (`docs/runs/README.md`).
- **X-host** — checked outside this binary: `cargo test --features harness,decision,process --test k7_group_host`.
- **X-identity — PASS.** `grp-topo-id` (λ = 0, the `RoutedAggregator` path) against `grp-role` per seed on trace entries (leave flag, act, raw score bits), PRIMARY bits and churn: 30/30 seeds identical.
- **X-recon — PASS.** PRIMARY recomputed from the final member sets reconstructed from the arrival orders and the trace (every trace consumed exactly) against `WorkflowResult::primary`, bitwise, per cell and seed: `grp-role` 30/30 · `grp-role-blind` 30/30 · `grp-topo` 30/30 · `grp-topo-id` 30/30 · `grp-topo-q` 30/30 · `grp-topo-solo` 30/30 · `ref-prune` 30/30 · `wf-asis` 30/30. Disclosure, not part of the predicate: recomputed churn equals `WorkflowResult::churn` on 240/240 cell-seeds.
- **S-determinism — PASS.** Every group cell re-run from scratch and compared per seed on trace entries, PRIMARY bits and churn: `grp-role` 30/30 · `grp-role-blind` 30/30 · `grp-topo` 30/30 · `grp-topo-id` 30/30 · `grp-topo-q` 30/30 · `grp-topo-solo` 30/30.
- **Seed invariance — PASS.** `grp-topo` rebuilt with `battery_seed = seed ^ 0x9E3779B97F4A7C15`, same comparison: 30/30 seeds identical.
- **S-learn (i) — PASS.** Per seed and cell: `s_learn_exact()`, `models_moved(..).ok` with its `expected == 0` exemption and non-vacuity tolerance `S_LEARN_VACUITY_TOL` = 1e-9, `begin_task_rejections == 0`: `grp-role` 30/30 · `grp-role-blind` 30/30 · `grp-topo` 30/30 · `grp-topo-id` 30/30 · `grp-topo-q` 30/30 · `grp-topo-solo` 30/30.
- **S-route — PASS.** Per seed on `grp-topo`, `grp-topo-q`, `grp-topo-solo`: `routed_reads` == ledger reads with `candidate_sensitive >= 1` and `roster >= 2`, block total > 0; on `grp-topo-id`, `grp-role`, `grp-role-blind`: `routed_reads == 0`. Block totals: `grp-topo` 8602 · `grp-topo-q` 8613 · `grp-topo-solo` 8602 · `grp-topo-id` 0 · `grp-role` 0 · `grp-role-blind` 0.
- S-learn (i) exempt models (`expected == 0`), as `(seed, model)`:
